  "description": "No left-wall cupboard. A full-height cupboard on the back wall (x 0-900, 600 deep) with a pair of 437 doors, then a 400-wide, 330-deep open shelving tower (to x 1300), floor to ceiling, with five lit shelves. Base cupboards with 6 doors under an oak top run on to the right-hand wall: 2538 long, 780 high, 330 deep. Inside, within its 18 boards (rear panels against the walls included): 864 × 582, 2407 high. Above the bench: a 75\" TV (1680 × 960), centred on the 2538 of clear wall, from 1100 to 2060. 250-deep shelves right across, 2538 long, below it at 1000 and above it at 2210. A middle shelf at 1550 either side, 279 long, 150 clear of the TV. A dresser on the front wall between the sink and the desk (x 823-2193): 1370 wide overall (its body 1330), 1940 high, 410 deep up to 830 (two drawers over two doors, under a wooden top), then 340 deep with three open shelves.From option 7 and the photo (new)"
